  "model_selection_justification": "M2_srgb (per-channel Levels + neutral-preserving 3x3 colour matrix in gamma-encoded sRGB) reduces held-out cluster-balanced CIEDE2000 from 5.043 (M1_srgb) to 3.703 (in-sample 3.864, held-out gap -0.161 <= 1.0), reaching the ~3-7/255 AI-reconstruction noise floor (~3.0-3.8 DE00). Gamma-encoded sRGB outperforms linear light (3.703 vs 3.806 on M2 and 3.296 vs 4.690 on M3). Although M3_srgb lowers mid-band val DE00 slightly to 3.296 using 51 extra knot parameters, it overfits single-pair missing gamut and spatial coupling: M2_srgb beats M3_srgb on cross-pair A->B generalization (7.136 vs 7.701 DE00) and on full Pair A flat_interior (8.134 vs 9.259 DE00)."
